QA4 C4. The same with an unexported field and an exported setter that nothing
in the package calls: code outside can call it through the interface value
(e.(interface{ Set(error) }).Set(...)). A function outside the reachable
program that stores to the field makes the field writable by unseen code.
-- args --
a.go:@b
